rst, then PR #120652, then this PR.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the ability for Godot to import and export 64-bit glTF binary format version 3 files. This GLB version 3 format is being defined as part of glTF 2.1, but the format itself is not tied to glTF 2.1: you can use a version 2 file to hold glTF 2.1 data, or use a version 3 file to hold glTF 2.0 data. It's this latter case which this PR supports. https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF/issues/2594\r\n\r\nThis PR will be followed by more PRs which will implement glTF 2.1 support in Godot over 2026 H2 and 2027.\r\n\r\nI made a similar PR to Khronos UnityGLTF: https://github.com/KhronosGroup/UnityGLTF/pull/905\r\n\r\nI made a similar PR to Unity glTFast: https://github.com/Unity-Technologies/com.unity.cloud.gltfast/pull/51","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"htt